# UNDERDELVE: secrets in the rock. Some walls are only pretending: walk into
# them and a gem waits behind. Cracked rock gives way to three blows of the
# pick, with ore inside or a gem behind.
game underdelve
wait 15
cheat no_gloom
cheat room 0 7 200 130
cheat clear_enemies
wait 5
expect money == 0
hold RIGHT 100
expect money == 100
cheat room 2 2 60 130
cheat clear_enemies
wait 5
hold LEFT 20
expect px == 48
press B
wait 20
press B
wait 20
press B
wait 20
expect tile_2_8 == 46
hold LEFT 40
expect money == 200
cheat room 5 0 250 130
cheat clear_enemies
wait 5
hold RIGHT 40
press B
wait 20
press B
wait 20
press B
wait 20
expect money == 300
